{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"featureID"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"state:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSDictionary","text":"NSDictionary<NSString *,id>"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"state"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"featureID","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identifier of the feature whose state to set."}]}]},{"name":"state","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of key-value pairs to merge into the feature’s state. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values should be valid JSON types."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the source is attached to a map and the update was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatched."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A feature’s state is a set of user-defined key-value pairs that are assigned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a feature at runtime. The state object is merged with any existing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-value pairs in the feature’s state. Feature state can be read in style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expressions through the "},{"code":"feature-state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" expression operator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The target feature must have an identifier in the underlying source data:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either an "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute in the original GeoJSON data, or an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method can only be used while the source is attached to a map."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/setfeaturestateforfeatureid:state:"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"]]},"metadata":{"title":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNShapeSource(im)setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setFeatureStateForFeatureID:state:"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets the state of a feature in this source.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"text","text":"Mapbox Vector Tile"},{"type":"text","text":" format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorTileSource"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","role":"collec